  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I've been looking into alternatives to Microsoft and Google for things like email and cloud storage.  I've shortlisted two relatively-popular options that often come up in discussions of privacy-focused email hosts, but I've found that I can't either of them as account logins for VRChat.\n\nI understand that running a large, public-facing platform like VRChat is a constant battle against bot activity, spam, and scams.\n\nBut in the case of VRC users with multi-year-old accounts, ID-verified accounts, accounts that are steady VRC+ subscribers, etc. etc., I think there's a case for more leeway with which email providers are allowed.",
